  "body_html": "<h1>Moment Maps for a Classical Type I Dual Pair</h1>\n<p>Let \\((G,G')=(U(V),U(V'))\\) be a type I reductive dual pair and identify\n\\[\nW=V\\otimes_D V'\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_D(V,V').\n\\]\nFor \\(w\\in W\\), let \\(w^\\ast\\in \\operatorname{Hom}_D(V',V)\\) be the adjoint with respect to the two forms. The moment maps are\n\\[\nM:W\\to \\mathbf g,\\qquad M(w)=w^\\ast w,\n\\]\nand\n\\[\nM':W\\to \\mathbf g',\\qquad M'(w)=ww^\\ast.\n\\]\nThey are equivariant for the \\(G\\times G'\\)-action and connect oscillator-model orbits to Moy-Prasad data on both sides of the dual pair.</p>",
  "proof_html": null,
